==Battleground==
*100 [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 4~8 seconds<sup>120f~240f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 4~6.67 seconds<sup>120f~200f</sup>.
*100 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Hippoe]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Jackie Peng]] spawns.
*When the base reaches 70% HP:
**10 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07~4 seconds<sup>2f~120f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

==Trivia==
*The name of this stage is a reference to the adventurer and television star [[wikipedia:Bear Grylls|Bear Grylls]].

